# Loiter > Time: loitertimeToolStripMenuItem_Click (GCSViews/FlightPlanner.cs:4776). Asks "Loiter
# Time", offering 5, and appends a LOITER_TIME (19) at the click with the answer in Param1. The OK
# keeps the answer as InputBox keeps every titled answer (InputBox.cs:73-84, 178-184); Cancel
# keeps nothing.

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen plan
window 1600x1200
budget 7

# The map first: a press before its first paint records nothing.
expect map.ready true
click map@0.45x0.40:right
click menu-loiter
click menu-loitertime
expect plan.prompt Loiter Time
expect plan.prompt.text Loiter Time
expect plan.prompt.value 5
key ctrl+u
type 12
key Return
expect plan.prompt none
expect config.InputBoxLoiterTimeLoiterTime 12
expect mission.items 1
expect mission.last.command 19
expect mission.last.p1 12
expect mission.last.position true

# Cancel is the handler's return: nothing more is added.
click map@0.55x0.45:right
click menu-loiter
click menu-loitertime
key Escape
expect plan.prompt none
expect mission.items 1
expect config.InputBoxLoiterTimeLoiterTime 12
